      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImage21"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Task: Paint a full-body high-resolution dark-fantasy character illustration showing the character from the front, head to toe, for the person whose face is shown in the small classic RPG portrait reference. Reconstruct natural high-resolution anatomy and costume detail; do not enlarge or trace the pixel blocks, and do not crop to a bust or close-up portrait.\n\nInput image: facial likeness, hair, skin tone, age and ornaments ONLY. Preserve this character's facial likeness, hair, skin tone and age while clearly incorporating any extra facial details described in the brief, and paint their complete full-body figure from the front, head to toe. Keep the clothing cleanly tailored and uncluttered, with a clear silhouette and at most one or two restrained personal details. \n\nSubject: Lord Woodborne of Wayrest, a handsome ambitious young human Breton nobleman in his late twenties with fair warm-tanned skin, normal rounded human ears, straight golden-blonde hair parted across his brow, charming hazel eyes, confident slight smile and clean-shaven jaw, wearing a cleanly tailored black velvet aristocratic doublet with a high collar and gold buttons.\n\nStyle: ART DIRECTION \u2014 VAGRANT STORY & OLD TABLETOP DARK FANTASY PEN-AND-INK CROSSHATCHING WITH MUTED WASH\n\nDraw the character as an accomplished pen-and-ink dark-fantasy illustration in the tradition of Akihiko Yoshida (Vagrant Story) and classic tabletop RPG manuals, finished with opaque muted gouache washes. Build a confident underlying ink drawing with crisp seams, dark-umber contours, fine directional crosshatching inside folds and shadows, and opaque local colour washes without glossy 3D shading.\n\nPresentation: Full-body isolated character shown from the front, head to toe, filling ~88% of the vertical portrait frame on a perfectly flat solid dark slate grey background, RGB 48,52,59. No floor, no scenery, no cast shadow, no border.",
        "",
        1024
      ]
    },
