      "widgets_values": [
        "Painting style of Larry Elmore, Brom style, gothic fantasy illustration, dark_fantasy_illustration.\n\nDrawn and painted as a vivid, punchy 1990s PC fantasy role-playing game character illustration: confident dark-umber pen-and-ink contour lines, fine crosshatching inside cloth folds and shadows, and opaque matte gouache colour planes (4 to 6 painted value groups per material). Plain flat dark slate-grey background, RGB 48,52,59, no floor, no scenery, no border.\n\nSubject: Full-body character portrait shown from the front, head to toe. Lord Woodborne of Wayrest, a handsome ambitious young human Breton nobleman in his late twenties with fair warm-tanned skin, normal rounded human ears, straight golden-blonde hair parted across his brow, charming hazel eyes, confident slight smile and clean-shaven jaw, wearing a cleanly tailored black velvet aristocratic doublet with a high collar and gold buttons."
